'''Eldreth Row''' is the outermost area of [[Dire Maul]], located outside the instance portals and before the [[Broken Commons]].  Numerous [[Gordunni]] [[ogre]]s patrol the area. The [[Dire Pool]] is located on the far western side, while one of the entrances to the [[Warpwood Quarter]] is on the far eastern side.

